{"id":485,"bangumiId":485,"type":2,"name":"涼宮ハルヒの憂鬱","name_cn":"凉宫春日的忧郁","date":"2006-04-02","year":"2006","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/21/8a/485_Et062.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/21/8a/485_Et062.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/21/8a/485_Et062.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/21/8a/485_Et062.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/21/8a/485_Et062.jpg"},"summary":"“我毕业于东中，叫做凉宫春日。我对普通的人类没有兴趣。你们之中要是有外星人、未来人、异世界人或者超能力者的话，就尽管来找我吧。”这是凉宫春日的宣言，也是她对于平庸生活的挑战。\r\n　　我们可能在很小时就不再相信圣诞老人的存在，也慢慢不会再对外星人，特异功能等等产生幻想。在生活的教化下习惯于平淡无奇的生活。可是不安于现状的凉宫同学却勇敢的建立起SOS团，用强烈的意志去试图改造这个了无新意的世界。她的忧郁，究竟从何而来，又将从何而去。","rating":{"rank":151,"total":19472,"count":{"1":38,"2":13,"3":35,"4":93,"5":229,"6":899,"7":3284,"8":7427,"9":5119,"10":2335},"score":8.2},"collection":{"on_hold":1306,"dropped":369,"wish":6382,"collect":31522,"doing":1383},"tags":[{"name":"京阿尼","count":5037,"total_count":217732},{"name":"涼宮ハルヒの憂鬱","count":2707,"total_count":2742},{"name":"SOS团","count":2676,"total_count":4700},{"name":"校园","count":2019,"total_count":473918},{"name":"团长","count":1889,"total_count":3059},{"name":"凉宫春日的忧郁","count":1768,"total_count":2194},{"name":"TV","count":1621,"total_count":1453959},{"name":"吐槽","count":1431,"total_count":40360},{"name":"轻小说改","count":1180,"total_count":511928},{"name":"2006","count":1149,"total_count":34992},{"name":"谷川流","count":1141,"total_count":2244},{"name":"大萌神","count":982,"total_count":4088},{"name":"凉宫春日","count":972,"total_count":11218},{"name":"轻小说","count":617,"total_count":11460},{"name":"2006年4月","count":401,"total_count":3756},{"name":"小说改","count":381,"total_count":169397},{"name":"杉田智和","count":369,"total_count":13084},{"name":"石原立也","count":321,"total_count":16453},{"name":"京都动画","count":269,"total_count":33726},{"name":"日常","count":260,"total_count":418062},{"name":"轻改","count":260,"total_count":156600},{"name":"奇幻","count":244,"total_count":49